## 4. Connecting AI clients

### Claude Desktop

Add this to `claude_desktop_config.json` (typically
`%APPDATA%\Claude\claude_desktop_config.json`):

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "revit-mcp-{{ namespace }}": {
      "command": "powershell.exe",
      "args": [
        "-NoProfile",
        "-ExecutionPolicy",
        "Bypass",
        "-File",
        "C:\\path\\to\\your\\workspace\\servers\\revit-mcp\\scripts\\start-stdio.ps1"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

### Cursor

1. Go to **Settings** -> **Features** -> **MCP**.
2. Click **+ Add New MCP Server**.
3. Name it `revit-mcp-{{ namespace }}`, choose type `command`, and use:
   `powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File C:\path\to\your\workspace\servers\revit-mcp\scripts\start-stdio.ps1`

